            "level": {
              "value": 14
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You starred in a war drama depicting First Emperor Taldaris's battles against the Grogrisant, a massive sixeyed lion, and Verksaris the Kingeater, a mighty dragon. To prepare for your role, you spent weeks in the wild observing and occasionally scrapping with any creature resembling Taldaris's legendary foes. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects from beasts and dragons."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
